 at the end of their struggle…?\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)\n\nNote: Released as part of the Echoes of Aincrad: Sword Art Online's game limited edition."},"tags":[{"name":"Full CGI","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Medieval","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Virtual World","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rural","rank":79,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Unanswered//butterfly: Sword Art Online","english":null,"native":"Unanswered//butterfly: Sword Art Online","romaji":"Unanswered//butterfly: Sword Art Online","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"Unanswered//butterfly"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"寂静不语的//蝴蝶"}]},"trailer":{"id":"tv1EZbG8pLI","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/tv1EZbG8pLI/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}